erson downstream. A stamp confirms origin. It says nothing about the linkage that materializes three transactions later. Demand the transaction number before anyone declares a mechanism the winner.\n\nWhere the Safetyist narrowed the eligibility bar to the non-consented irreversible re-identification class, that prevents completion, and I will not put a notify duty on a harm that never happens. That mechanism is superior for that scope precisely because there is no injury to notice. Hold the line where completion is not preventable. The arrest-record case is the wound none of the three gates reaches: a lawfully-public record pulled into a tenant-screening feed, no data crossing, nothing computed, reproducing the racial sorting that the NEJM race-adjusted algorithm work documents — where a formula assigned black patients lower risk scores and delayed their referral for specialist care. Post-hoc audit detects that sorting pattern. It never tells the person their arrest record got recontextualized, and it never gives them standing to fight it. So the question I leave with all three: which mechanism tells that person, and lets them contest it, when no data moved and nothing was computed?",
